    "text": "Kylie Felicich takes female 50-59 title in Noyo Headlands Race 5K in Fort Bragg on Aug. 8, 2026\nBy\nG. R. HughesKylie Felicich won the female 50-59 division of the 5K run at Noyo Headlands Race in Fort Bragg, California, on Aug. 8, 2026, finishing 31st overall with a time of 30:09.72, according to RunSignUp results.\nHer hometown was listed as Mendocino, California.",
